<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Rodman cuts Mallinckrodt.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Rodman cuts Mallinckrodt.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Rodman and Renshaw analyst James Keeney said he downgraded Mallinckrodt Inc to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- He cited the &quot;declerating tone&quot; of the company's fiscal second quarter business and the &quot;slow pace&quot; of its business restructuring.</p>
<p>-- Cut fiscal 1997 estimate to $2.79 from $2.85 and fiscal 1998 to $3.15 from $3.25.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1/8 at 43-3/4.</p>
</text>
